# --- Tauri / Rust ---
/src-tauri/target/
/plugins/*/target/
Cargo.lock

# The Android Studio project is generated fresh by `tauri android init`
# (see .github/workflows/android-build.yml and README) — nothing under
# gen/ is committed, the same way the old Capacitor setup didn't commit
# its generated android/ folder either.
/src-tauri/gen/

# tauri icon overwrites these from icon-source/app-icon-1024.png on every
# build — see README "App icon". Keeping a committed starting set (so the
# repo isn't broken before the first `tauri icon` run) but ignoring the
# .ico Pillow-generated placeholder specifically has no benefit, so this
# whole folder stays tracked; nothing to ignore here.

# --- Signing secrets — NEVER commit these ---
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
release.keystore

# --- Node ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Android Studio / Gradle (only relevant if gen/ is ever committed locally for debugging) ---
*.iml
.gradle/
local.properties
